   "source": "community",
   "text": "Corporal Adamore,\r\n\r\nAt first light you are to muster a force of no more than 10 marines and report to a bounty hunter by the name of Terry Longdrink. You will be joining him in pursuit of a dangerous deserter whom you should presume to be armed and hostile.\r\n\r\nThis bounty hunter was a trusted ally of the Lord Admiral before his passing, and I expect you to show Longdrink the same deference you'd show any superior officer. \r\n\r\n--Lieutenant Benedict",
   "time": 1792241853,
   "title": "Benedict's Orders",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  }
